00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,030
Everything is ready.

578
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:56,030
E Meng has already been tied up here.

579
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:57,310
When Chen Bingqiang comes in a while,

580
00:19:57,310 --> 00:19:58,160
we will hand over the goods

581
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,890
and the person at the same time.

582
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:09,660
You're all dressed up?

583
00:20:10,110 --> 00:20:11,310
We're professional.

584
00:20:11,550 --> 00:20:12,550
I was wondering.

585
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:15,240
We went looking for her

586
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,500
and couldn't find her.

587
00:20:16,790 --> 00:20:18,190
You guys tied her up here.

588
00:20:20,490 --> 00:20:21,920
Mr. Huang's kidnapping—

589
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:23,220
isn't it a bit too much?

590
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:24,680
Yes.

591
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,350
Here, take this.

592
00:20:29,430 --> 00:20:31,460
W-What is this?

593
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,280
A gun.

594
00:20:36,350 --> 00:20:37,590
Why did you get this?

595
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:38,790
If Chen Bingqiang doesn't listen later,

596
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:39,590
just kill him.

597
00:20:41,420 --> 00:20:42,160
This thing is freezing cold.

598
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,290
What do I need it for?

599
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:45,790
No, what are you afraid of?

600
00:20:45,790 --> 00:20:47,030
What's there to be afraid of with the gun?

601
00:20:47,030 --> 00:20:48,030
Hold it. You...

602
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,310
I... I...

603
00:20:50,030 --> 00:20:51,110
I don't dare to hold it. Hurry up.

604
00:20:51,110 --> 00:20:51,510
Hurry up.

605
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:52,910
Where did you get it from?

606
00:20:54,370 --> 00:20:55,550
I'm afraid of this thing.

607
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,810
Mr. Huang has several lives on his hands!

608
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,640
I don't know about
Mr. Huang having lives on his hands,

609
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,510
but I know he committed fraud

610
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:04,350
and kidnapping.

611
00:21:06,550 --> 00:21:07,350
And also,

612
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,510
I am actually Gao Jiaoshi.

613
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:13,640
Isn't this Gao Jiaoba?

614
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:14,460
And Gao Jiaojiu.

615
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:15,250
Jiaoba.

616
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:16,050
Jiaoba.

617
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,070
-No, Jiaoba.
-No, Jiaoba.

618
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:18,030
Jiaoba.

619
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,070
-You didn't say we had to kill anyone!
-You didn't say we had to kill anyone!

620
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:20,480
-Jiaoba, I can't do this!
-Jiaoba, I can't do this!

621
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,210
I can't do it!

622
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,270
Let's go, let's go!

623
00:21:22,270 --> 00:21:22,830
I can't do it!

624
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:23,360
Let's go!

625
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:29,920
Give it to me.

626
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,030
I-I can't chase them anymore.

627
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:32,310
They're running away with it if I do.

628
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,510
Hurry up.

629
00:21:33,510 --> 00:21:34,790
Just take it. What are you afraid of?

630
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,110
Hurry up. No, this thing can't...

631
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:36,880
He's here.

632
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:37,640
He's here.

633
00:21:41,970 --> 00:21:42,900
Chen Bingqiang.

634
00:21:43,750 --> 00:21:44,350
Darling.

635
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,510
Darling, I'm here.

636
00:21:45,510 --> 00:21:46,510
Stop right there.

637
00:21:49,510 --> 00:21:50,710
The stuff you wanted.

638
00:22:07,030 --> 00:22:07,750
Darling,

639
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:08,550
are you okay?

640
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,240
Shut up.

641
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:11,590
She's tied up like that.

642
00:22:11,590 --> 00:22:12,840
Do you think she's okay?

643
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,160
Jiaoba, it's not right.

644
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:14,830
There are only 3.

645
00:22:14,830 --> 00:22:16,160
Do you think she's fine?

646
00:22:16,280 --> 00:22:17,610
You only brought 3 here?

647
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:18,660
I only took 3.

648
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:19,780
Talking back, huh?

649
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:25,790
Hey, hey, don't touch her!

650
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:27,070
Don't!

651
00:22:27,070 --> 00:22:27,640
I'm telling you!

652
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,480
How many did you take?

653
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:29,830
I only took 3!

654
00:22:29,830 --> 00:22:30,480
How many?

655
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:32,830
I really only took 3!

656
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:36,640
Don't touch her! Don't touch her!

657
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:37,310
Are there any more?

658
00:22:37,310 --> 00:22:37,920
No more!

659
00:22:38,550 --> 00:22:39,110
No more?

660
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,510
I have another secret.

661
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:41,710
Speak. Speak. Speak.

662
00:22:42,550 --> 00:22:43,680
When we and Mr. Huang

663
00:22:44,030 --> 00:22:45,360
scammed Shapu Village,

664
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:48,540
we actually scammed
more than 1.7 million yuan.

665
00:22:48,750 --> 00:22:50,080
It was 2.7 million yuan.

666
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:52,920
Chris and I pocketed 1 million yuan.

667
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:55,240
I'll take out the 800,000 yuan I pocketed

668
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,240
and give it to you.

669
00:22:57,630 --> 00:22:58,390
Kill him.

670
00:22:58,530 --> 00:23:00,160
Why did you take it out again?

671
00:23:00,310 --> 00:23:01,240
He knows too many secrets.

672
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:01,790
Kill him.

673
00:23:02,350 --> 00:23:03,880
You have it, so kill him.

674
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:04,640
I'm dealing with her.

675
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:06,110
You have to do this yourself!

676
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:06,840
I can't do it.

677
00:23:07,790 --> 00:23:08,710
I don't know how to use it.

678
00:23:08,710 --> 00:23:09,430
You use it.

679
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:10,960
No way!

680
00:23:11,350 --> 00:23:12,920
He knows too many of Mr. Huang's secrets!

681
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:13,830
Stop messing around!

682
00:23:13,830 --> 00:23:15,110
You shoot! Here!

683
00:23:15,510 --> 00:23:16,240
You shoot!

684
00:23:16,270 --> 00:23:17,330
What are you doing?

685
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:26,650
Darling,

686
00:23:27,130 --> 00:23:27,730
are you...

687
00:23:37,170 --> 00:23:38,570
Did you film everything?

688
00:23:40,270 --> 00:23:41,350
I got it!

689
00:23:41,430 --> 00:23:42,500
Ximei?

690
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:43,510
I got it!

691
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:44,510
Good!

692
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:46,740
Come on!

693
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:49,180
Let's give everyone a round of applause!

694
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:58,030
Gratitude goes to our best actress,

695
00:23:58,030 --> 00:23:59,790
Ms. Chen Jiazhen!

696
00:24:04,830 --> 00:24:06,830
And the one whose acting has improved
by leaps and bounds,

697
00:24:06,830 --> 00:24:08,240
Mr. Chen Jiahao!

698
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:09,070
Me?

699
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:12,270
Chen Jiahao!

700
00:24:15,420 --> 00:24:17,880
My gratitude goes to
our hidden camera crew!

701
00:24:20,790 --> 00:24:23,270
And the lighting and grip crew!

702
00:24:24,890 --> 00:24:27,040
And our explosives team, Mr. Maling!

703
00:24:29,350 --> 00:24:31,030
Ladies and gentlemen,

704
00:24:31,030 --> 00:24:32,030
most importantly,

705
00:24:32,030 --> 00:24:34,350
let's thank our director,

706
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:35,720
Zhou Ke!

707
00:24:39,550 --> 00:24:40,240
Okay.

708
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:42,720
Quiet!

709
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:45,110
-Zhou Ke!
-Zhou Ke!

710
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:46,850
Chen Bingqiang.

711
00:24:48,510 --> 00:24:49,200
I admit,

712
00:24:49,530 --> 00:24:50,900
we took a gamble

713
00:24:51,360 --> 00:24:53,470
that the villain dies
from talking too much,

714
00:24:53,470 --> 00:24:55,070
but you really did talk a lot.

715
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:57,110
You just admitted yourself

716
00:24:57,110 --> 00:24:59,640
that you and Mr. Huang
conspired to defraud our village

717
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:00,790
of 2.7 million yuan.

718
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,440
We have recorded all the evidence

719
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,920
of your crimes.

720
00:25:08,410 --> 00:25:09,760
Are you all crazy?

721
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,350
Are you crazy?

722
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:14,430
I know a little
about criminal procedure law.

723
00:25:15,050 --> 00:25:16,780
I didn't actually kill anyone.

724
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:20,110
With these videos of yours,

725
00:25:20,110 --> 00:25:22,240
I can sue you for forging them!

726
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:23,770
I won't admit to any of them!

727
00:25:24,070 --> 00:25:25,130
I'm reporting him!

728
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:29,420
I'll be a state's witness.

729
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:32,890
You scared me to death just now.

730
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,090
We don't need you to.

731
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,600
We were not shooting a video.

732
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:38,270
We are live streaming!

733
00:25:38,270 --> 00:25:39,200
-Right!
-Right!

734
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:40,550
Guys,

735
00:25:40,990 --> 00:25:42,160
did you all see that?

736
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:44,830
The masses have sharp eyes.

737
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,240
It's this guy.

738
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:49,110
Everyone has seen

739
00:25:49,110 --> 00:25:50,440
all your crimes!

740
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:51,640
It's over. It's over.

741
00:25:55,790 --> 00:25:56,790
I announce,

742
00:25:57,350 --> 00:25:58,590
Operation Huang Hunt

743
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,790
is a wrap!

744
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:08,390
Not bad!

745
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,480
That's a wrap!

746
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:14,010
The phone is turned off.

747
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,400
Huang Gai, according to our investigation,

748
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:20,270
you are suspected of fraud,

749
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:21,160
involving a huge amount of money.

750
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:23,620
Please come back with us
for investigation.

751
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:32,840
Welcome to Shapu Village!

752
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,350
Please line up over there!

753
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:50,280
Come on. Come on.

754
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,680
Hurry.

755
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,880
Eat it while it's hot.

756
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:04,440
This is my first time making fish balls.

757
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:04,960
My very first time.

758
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:05,830
Hurry, try it.

759
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:06,770
It's definitely fine.

760
00:27:06,770 --> 00:27:07,330
Try it.

761
00:27:13,070 --> 00:27:13,880
Sorry.

762
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,440
Hot, why is it so hot?

763
00:27:19,300 --> 00:27:19,830
How is it?

764
00:27:20,790 --> 00:27:22,000
I told you it's okay!

765
00:27:22,790 --> 00:27:23,790
-It's so delicious!
-Come on.

766
00:27:23,790 --> 00:27:24,200
Strike while the iron is hot.

767
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:24,830
Wait.

768
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:26,720
Well, I...

769
00:27:27,900 --> 00:27:28,480
It's so delicious.

770
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,920
I want to save some for tonight.

771
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:31,050
You should eat more.

772
00:27:31,310 --> 00:27:32,590
You've been working so hard
on rebuilding the welfare center lately.

773
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:33,720
You've lost weight.

774
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:35,700
You rebuilt it so fast.

775
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,110
Good thing he didn't dig too deep.

776
00:27:37,110 --> 00:27:39,880
Otherwise, it would have taken
forever to rebuild it.

777
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:41,070
I just hope the welfare center

778
00:27:41,070 --> 00:27:42,350
will be safe from now on.

779
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:43,750
And we won't run into any more bad guys.

780
00:27:43,750 --> 00:27:44,480
Don't worry.

781
00:27:44,790 --> 00:27:46,590
The bad guys have all been caught.

782
00:27:46,590 --> 00:27:48,350
They've gotten
the punishment they deserve.

783
00:27:48,350 --> 00:27:49,110
There won't be any more.

784
00:27:49,110 --> 00:27:50,070
I'll protect you from now on.

785
00:27:50,070 --> 00:27:50,590
Okay.

786
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,510
What is it?

787
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:56,350
I have an idea.

788
00:27:57,110 --> 00:28:00,510
Since our recent experience
has been so full of ups and downs,

789
00:28:00,590 --> 00:28:01,270
is it possible

790
00:28:01,270 --> 00:28:02,750
to turn it into a TV series?

791
00:28:03,350 --> 00:28:04,210
We could call it

792
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:06,070
"KING OF COMEDY 2."

793
00:28:07,070 --> 00:28:07,930
Who is COMEDY 2?

794
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,270
A buddy of mine.

795
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:11,750
No.

796
00:28:11,750 --> 00:28:13,680
It's the second part of "KING OF COMEDY."

797
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:15,280
How about "KING OF COMEDY 8"?

798
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:18,050
Attention, villagers!

799
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:20,640
Please gather at the welfare center!

800
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:23,370
The scammed money has been recovered!

801
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:26,200
The scammed money has been recovered!

802
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:29,410
Let's go.

803
00:28:30,270 --> 00:28:31,000
Wait, wait.

804
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,720
This is my brother's business.

805
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:34,110
Let him handle it himself.

806
00:28:34,110 --> 00:28:35,640
Let him be an adult for once.

807
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:39,880
Okay. Thank you, Jiahao!

808
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:40,480
I'm sorry.

809
00:28:41,790 --> 00:28:43,680
Chen Shark, 30,000 yuan!

810
00:28:43,970 --> 00:28:44,640
Mr. Shark.

811
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:45,110
Jiahao.

812
00:28:45,110 --> 00:28:45,480
I'm sorry.

813
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:46,350
Thank you.

814
00:28:46,350 --> 00:28:48,000
You got my money back.

815
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,720
This is my pension money.

816
00:28:50,110 --> 00:28:51,550
Count it and see if it's all there.

817
00:28:51,550 --> 00:28:52,200
Okay.

818
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:55,480
Chen Haidan, 15,000 yuan!

819
00:28:57,440 --> 00:28:58,240
I'm sorry.

820
00:28:58,550 --> 00:28:59,680
As long as you're safe,

821
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:01,270
money is a small matter.

822
00:29:02,310 --> 00:29:03,790
Zu Xian, 20,000 yuan!

823
00:29:10,590 --> 00:29:11,590
Okay, okay, okay!

824
00:29:11,790 --> 00:29:12,880
It's all up to you!

825
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:13,740
Uncle Huixian.

826
00:29:14,510 --> 00:29:15,270
Jiahao.

827
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:16,920
I told you long ago

828
00:29:17,160 --> 00:29:18,160
that you would definitely be able

829
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,590
to get the villagers' money back.

830
00:29:19,590 --> 00:29:20,260
Good job!

831
00:29:21,110 --> 00:29:22,750
That's not what you said before.

832
00:29:22,750 --> 00:29:24,640
You said I was good for nothing.

833
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:27,160
D-Did I say that?

834
00:29:27,830 --> 00:29:28,960
Well...

835
00:29:29,830 --> 00:29:31,350
Let bygones be bygones.

836
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:32,770
We have to look forward.

837
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:34,510
The result is good.

838
00:29:34,510 --> 00:29:35,000
Right?

839
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:35,590
Right.

840
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:37,240
Well.

841
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,100
Jiahao.

842
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,530
For the upcoming election,

843
00:29:40,790 --> 00:29:42,520
I think you have a great chance.

844
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:43,860
Uncle Huixian.

845
00:29:44,070 --> 00:29:45,930
I'm not planning to run this time.

846
00:29:47,350 --> 00:29:49,480
Why did you suddenly decide not to run?

847
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:52,940
I wanted to be the chief before
because I admired my dad.

848
00:29:52,940 --> 00:29:55,110
He could take such good care of everyone.

849
00:29:55,110 --> 00:29:56,270
After going through so much,

850
00:29:56,270 --> 00:29:57,160
I also realized

851
00:29:57,750 --> 00:29:59,110
that I'm really not that smart,

852
00:29:59,110 --> 00:30:00,370
and that I aim too high.

853
00:30:00,480 --> 00:30:01,810
I need more refinement.

854
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,960
But don't worry, everyone.

855
00:30:03,960 --> 00:30:05,510
Whether I'm the chief or not,

856
00:30:05,510 --> 00:30:07,070
I will always do my best for our village,

857
00:30:07,070 --> 00:30:08,160
giving my all

858
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:09,220
until my dying day!

859
00:30:09,510 --> 00:30:11,170
It's from my father's letter,

860
00:30:11,190 --> 00:30:12,200
the final chapter!

861
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:13,640
